# Line endings are part of the contract: the hooks are bash scripts and the CI runs them
# on Linux. Force LF for anything that is executed, so a Windows checkout cannot change
# what CI runs. Documentation and JSON may follow core.autocrlf.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
# Frontmatter targets of tests/agents-lint.sh are first-line checked, so they must not
# become CRLF on a Windows checkout (1.2.0: 로컬 실측 0D 0A 오탐 제거).
.claude/agents/*.md text eol=lf
.claude/commands/*.md text eol=lf
